              "text": "He was quite angry because they had gone into the closed garden.",
              "audioStart": 52.8,
              "audioEnd": 55.788
            },
            {
              "text": "He took them both home and gave them a little task to do as a penalty.",
              "audioStart": 56.65,
              "audioEnd": 60.212
            },
            {
              "text": "They walked along the long road while the sun was high in the sky.",
              "audioStart": 61.075,
              "audioEnd": 64.237
            },
            {
              "text": "The day was warm, and many people were out in the country.",
              "audioStart": 65.1,
              "audioEnd": 68.1
            },
            {
              "text": "Benjamin and Peter had always enjoyed playing games together, but this day was different.",
              "audioStart": 68.963,
              "audioEnd": 73.662
            },
            {
              "text": "They had planned to find some fresh food near the vegetable house.",
              "audioStart": 74.525,
              "audioEnd": 77.638
            },
            {
              "text": "If they had known about the large cat, they would have stayed at home.",
              "audioStart": 78.5,
              "audioEnd": 81.638
            },
            {
              "text": "Such problems often happen when young animals do not listen to their parents.",
              "audioStart": 82.5,
              "audioEnd": 86.463
            },
            {
              "text": "Mr. Bunny had told them many times that the place was dangerous.",
              "audioStart": 87.325,
              "audioEnd": 90.675
            },
            {
              "text": "The high wall was built to keep small animals away from the valuable plants.",
              "audioStart": 91.537,
              "audioEnd": 95.3
            },
            {
              "text": "Peter knew that rule well, which is why he stopped at the top.",
              "audioStart": 96.162,
              "audioEnd": 99.263
            },
            {
              "text": "Benjamin, who was less careful, went inside without thinking about the result.",
              "audioStart": 100.125,
              "audioEnd": 104.438
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "When the big cat appeared, both cousins felt their hearts beat fast.",
              "audioStart": 105.3,
              "audioEnd": 108.875
            },
            {
              "text": "They ran quickly to the container, hoping the animal would not see them.",
              "audioStart": 109.737,
              "audioEnd": 113.362
            },
            {
              "text": "The container was heavy, and once it fell over them, escape was impossible.",
              "audioStart": 114.225,
              "audioEnd": 118.287
            },
            {
              "text": "Minutes passed slowly while they sat in the dark space.",
              "audioStart": 119.15,
              "audioEnd": 122.1
            },
            {
              "text": "Every sound outside made them think the cat was coming closer.",
              "audioStart": 122.963,
              "audioEnd": 126.213
            },
            {
              "text": "They hoped someone would come to help them before it was too late.",
              "audioStart": 127.075,
              "audioEnd": 130.075
            },
            {
              "text": "Old Mr. Bunny was looking for them across the whole area.",
              "audioStart": 130.938,
              "audioEnd": 133.838
            },
            {
              "text": "When he found the container, he used his big stick to move it away.",
              "audioStart": 134.7,
              "audioEnd": 138.075
            },
            {
              "text": "Both cousins were very glad to see him and quickly ran out.",
              "audioStart": 138.938,
              "audioEnd": 142
            },
            {
              "text": "Mr. Bunny spoke to them firmly about going where they should not be.",
              "audioStart": 142.863,
              "audioEnd": 146.15
            },
            {
              "text": "They walked back to their home with their father, feeling sorry for their actions.",
              "audioStart": 147.012,
              "audioEnd": 151.075
            },
            {
              "text": "That experience taught them a valuable lesson about following important rules.",
              "audioStart": 151.938,
              "audioEnd": 155.912
            },
            {
              "text": "From that day forward, they always listened to old Mr. Bunny and stayed away from trouble.",
              "audioStart": 156.775,
              "audioEnd": 161.4
            },
            {
              "text": "They learned that ignoring parents always leads to terrible danger.",
              "audioStart": 162.262,
              "audioEnd": 165.575
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun began to set behind the high hills as they finished their long walk.",
              "audioStart": 166.438,
              "audioEnd": 170.262
            },
            {
              "text": "Each cousin promised never to break the rules again.",
              "audioStart": 171.125,
              "audioEnd": 173.65
            },
            {
              "text": "The evening air became cool, and they felt tired after such a difficult day.",
              "audioStart": 174.512,
              "audioEnd": 178.75
            },
            {
              "text": "When they finally reached their home, they went straight to bed.",
              "audioStart": 179.613,
              "audioEnd": 182.588
            },
            {
              "text": "They slept deeply and dreamed of quiet days without any fear.",
              "audioStart": 183.45,
              "audioEnd": 186.613
            },
            {
              "text": "Their father watched over them while they rested quietly.",
              "audioStart": 187.475,
              "audioEnd": 190.225
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that they understood the lesson completely.",
              "audioStart": 191.088,
              "audioEnd": 193.45
            },
            {
              "text": "Life returned to normal for the little family in the quiet country.",
              "audioStart": 194.312,
              "audioEnd": 197.575
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
